      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Goya’s dramatic Black Paintings and Caprichos inspired 20th‑century giants Pablo Picasso and Salvador Dalí.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
